### Créer un contact
POST https://flow.icones-soft.com/api/v1/contacts
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: x9DtsmKk8XaKlxpZ3XrumVl6EgyaKC4PBFzDy2d4CoY

{
    "name": "Jean Dupont",
    "email": "jean@example.com",
    "phone": "0123456789",
    "mobile": "0612345678",
    "company": "Ma Société"
}

###

### Modifier un contact
PUT https://flow.icones-soft.com/api/v1/contacts/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: x9DtsmKk8XaKlxpZ3XrumVl6EgyaKC4PBFzDy2d4CoY

{
    "name": "Jean Dupont Modifié",
    "email": "jean.nouveau@example.com",
    "phone": "0987654321"
}

###

### Modifier partiellement un contact (PATCH)
PATCH https://flow.icones-soft.com/api/v1/contacts/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: x9DtsmKk8XaKlxpZ3XrumVl6EgyaKC4PBFzDy2d4CoY

{
    "name": "Ben ALI 2",
    "email": "jBen@example.com",
    "company": "Ma Boite"
}

###

### Modifier l'avatar d'un contact (avec image en base64)
PATCH https://flow.icones-soft.com/api/v1/contacts/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: x9DtsmKk8XaKlxpZ3XrumVl6EgyaKC4PBFzDy2d4CoY

{
    "image": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNk+M9QDwADhgGAWjR9awAAAABJRU5ErkJggg=="
}
